[{"type": "subtitle", "time": 3964.95, "timestamp": "01:06:04", "text": "覚えなくても、おそらく既にその曲を知っているだろうということは分かっている。 でも"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 3968.39, "timestamp": "01:06:08", "text": "まあ、もう100"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 3970.63, "timestamp": "01:06:10", "text": "回は聴いたよ。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 3972.549, "timestamp": "01:06:12", "text": "バイバイ。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 3975.109, "timestamp": "01:06:15", "text": "うん、君はプロだね。 あなたは歌も"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 3978.789, "timestamp": "01:06:18", "text": "再現も何でもプロ級ですね。   私はできません"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 3980.39, "timestamp": "01:06:20", "text": "。 うん。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 3981.75, "timestamp": "01:06:21", "text": "えっと、他に何かありますか？"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 3983.829, "timestamp": "01:06:23", "text": "練習する。   これで全部だと"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 3991.75, "timestamp": "01:06:31", "text": "うん、レモンの作り方をもう一度覚えなきゃ。 私は"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 3992.71, "timestamp": "01:06:32", "text": "すべてを忘れてしまった。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 3996.23, "timestamp": "01:06:36", "text": "私はその曲をもう一度聴きます。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 3999.829, "timestamp": "01:06:39", "text": "レモン。 ええ、全部です。 こんにちは、ええと、完全に"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 4000.87, "timestamp": "01:06:40", "text": "フェチです。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 4002.23, "timestamp": "01:06:42", "text": "ああ、"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 4003.67, "timestamp": "01:06:43", "text": "これだ。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 4006.309, "timestamp": "01:06:46", "text": "そう、"}]